<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-early-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Gasterosteus doryssus_early at 33 µm (10.02 Ma) (Gasterosteus doryssus_early)",
        "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Gasterosteus doryssus_early at 33 µm (10.02 Ma) faithfully reproduces Gasterosteus doryssus_early morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-early-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
